    "Stem": "Zenith Bay sold 22,000 units but produced only 19,000 units during the period, drawing down beginning inventory. Fixed manufacturing overhead in inventory is $5 per unit under absorption costing. Compared with absorption costing, what income effect should variable costing report?",
